    "summary": "Use it in the opposing player's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an **ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY REGIMENT** unit of yours, other than an **ARTILLERY** or **CHARACTER** unit, is **destroyed**. Target that **INFANTRY** unit despite its destruction, and roll a D6. If you roll 3+:\n\n- put a [Cult Ambush](vsdata:ability/genestealer-cults.cult-ambush) marker at any spot on the battlefield more than 8\" horizontally from every enemy unit, or none if no spot qualifies\n- add a copy of the destroyed unit to your army, in [Cult Ambush](vsdata:ability/genestealer-cults.cult-ambush)\n\nThe copy begins at full **Starting Strength** with every wound remaining, and its models' **[[ONE SHOT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/one-shot)** weapons count as unfired.\n\nUsable once per battle.",
